**COMPLEX TASK:**
UNDERSTAND → RECON → DECOMPOSE → MULTI-PLAN → MULTI-AGENT → PARALLEL RESEARCH → SYNTHESIS → CRITIC → EXECUTE → VERIFY → EVOLVE → FINAL AUDIT → STOP

