UNDERSTAND → INVESTIGATE → RESEARCH → DECOMPOSE → PLAN → GENERATE COMPETING PLANS → SPAWN SPECIALISTS → PARALLEL WORK → COLLECT → VERIFY → SELECT BEST → MERGE COMPONENTS → MASTER PLAN → EXECUTE → TEST → CRITIQUE → REPAIR → EVOLVE → RE-EVALUATE → FINAL AUDIT → DELIVER → STOP

