RECEIVED → UNDERSTAND → RECON → DECOMPOSE → GENERATE_PLANS → PARALLEL_RESEARCH → COLLECT → COMPARE → SYNTHESIZE → CRITIC
├── RESEARCH → REVISE → REPLAN → (back to GENERATE_PLANS)
└── PASS → PARALLEL_EXECUTION → INTEGRATION → TEST → VERIFY
